## 4. Synthesis

{{algorithm:0}}

The topology generated by surreal intervals is exactly the order topology. It is totally separated, nowhere locally compact, and noncontractible; every path is constant and every fundamental group is trivial. The project invites further study of compact intervals, singleton quasicomponents, higher homotopy groups, and birthday bounds.
